    <string name="upload_guidance_message">1. Enter the subject name for which you want to upload the Paper.\n\n2. Provide the course name, semester. If these details match your profile, they will be fetched automatically; otherwise, you can enter them manually.\n\n3. Select the paper type — either Semester paper or Midterm.\n\n4. If you\'ve selected Question Paper, choose the relevant session.\n\n5. If the Question Paper is for a midterm exam, select the midterm type — e.g., 1st, 2nd, or 3rd.\n\n6. Attach the files:\n&#8226; For Question Papers, only image files (photos) are allowed.\n\nNote : \n&#8226; Providing false information intentionally could result in an account ban.\n&#8226; The price for your paper will be automatically set by our team</string>
